title: "PoET²S: Discrete-event simulator for twin-trust-weighted consensus"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the PoET²S consensus protocol and seven
  baseline mechanisms (PoW, PoS, PBFT, DPoS, PoS+Twin, PBFT+Twin,
  DPoS+Twin) evaluated on a smart-grid testbed calibrated to public
  energy datasets.
